      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n24 Pirc Mhuire, Tullow, Co. Carlow\nTwo-Bedroom Residence in a Prime Residential Location\nEircode: R93 CF29\n\nREA Dawson are delighted to present this Pleasant two-bedroom property to the market. Maintained in good condition throughout, the property would benefit from some modernisation, offering purchasers an excellent opportunity to create a home tailored to their own style and requirements.\n\nNo. 24 Pirc Mhuire offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation extending throughout the property, together with a generous enclosed rear yard. This home is ideally suited to first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a conveniently located family residence.\n\nLocation\n24 Pirc Mhuire is a well-established and highly regarded development in Tullow, within walking distance of Tullow market square. The area offers convenient access to a wide range of local amenities, including shops, schools, restaurants, sports facilities, and regular bus services to Dublin and Carlow.\n\nApproximate Distances:\n\nCarlow Town: 15km\n\nM9 Motorway (Junction 5): 11km\n\nDublin: 80km\n\n \n\nAccommodation\n\nKitchen: (1.7 x 3.4 m2)\n\nFitted wall and floor and sink units\n\n \n\nLiving Room: (4.7 x 2.7 m2)\n\nFitted carpet floor\n\n \n\nSitting Room (3.2 x 4.5 m2)\n\nOpen fireplace with stone surround\n\n \n\nUtility (5.3 x 3.6m2)\n\nLarge utility area with WC WHB, shower room and plumbing for washing machine.\n\n \n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom No. 1: (4.5 x 3.2 m2)\n\nFitted carpet floor and built in wardrobes\n\n \n\nBedroom No. 2: (3.1 x 3.1 m2)\n\nFitted carpet floor and built in wardrobes\n\n \n\nFamily Bathroom: (1.8 x 1.7 m2)\n\nWC, WHB, bath with overhead shower.\n\n \n\nGarage/Storage Shed (2.4 x 4.8m2)\n\nOutside:\n\nEnclosed back garden with rear access to the property.\n\n \n\nFeatures:\n\nHighly sought-after residential location\n\nWithin walking distance of Tullow tow Centre\n\n \n\nDirections: R93 CF29\n\nViewing strictly by appointment only.\n\n"
      }
